,"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair on the middle came in at 33% of normal, and September to October at 34%. So far in 2026, March to April on the middle came in at 162% of normal. Grid 24760 had its driest year in 1988 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
